id: pm-obbh43
title: "GH-740: make the documented aggregate SDK barrel complete and continuously derived"
description: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/740. The documented @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk compatibility aggregate omits 45 supported exports present on contracts, governance, query, and runtime subpaths. Restore the public contract or explicitly govern exclusions, and derive a CI assertion from the live subpath surface so drift cannot recur."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:sdk",compatibility,contracts,github-issue
