comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T12:46:31.198Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-07-26: searched every status for aggregate barrel completeness, 45 missing exports, SDK query/contracts/runtime/governance exports, and snapshot parity. Closed pm-e6tm5c governs per-entrypoint surface drift, pm-38bskj governs tiering, pm-lnswp0 governs snapshot packaging, and pm-te6elw governs action reachability; none owns cross-entrypoint aggregate completeness, so this is the canonical GH-740 child."
  "2026-07-26T19:42:51.095Z","harness:codex","Evidence: completed a derived SDK aggregate census over all supported contracts, governance, query, and runtime exports. The aggregate now exposes every supported non-test symbol; the only exclusion is the documented private test hook. Snapshot schema v2 fails closed on missing aggregate symbols and packed consumer proof resolved 954 aggregate exports with zero missing symbols. Linked test passed; full repository coverage passed 6,425 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; lint/static gates are green."
  "2026-07-26T19:49:04.543Z","harness:codex","Installed-package acceptance: the fresh Bun consumer read aggregate_completeness with 1,217 covered symbols and zero missing; the unrelated npm-prefix acceptance independently resolved 954 runtime aggregate exports and zero omissions."
  "2026-07-26T19:51:24.408Z","harness:codex","PR evidence: completed implementation is published in broad SDK delivery PR #753 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/753. Hosted checks and the exact-head AI review loop will be recorded after completion."
  "2026-07-26T20:35:37.439Z","harness:codex","Evidence clarification: 954 is the runtime JavaScript namespace export count observed by importing the packed aggregate SDK, while 1,217 is the declaration-level supported-symbol census deduplicated across all governed non-testing SDK subpaths. They intentionally measure different scopes; both reported zero omissions. Review hardening now uses own-property exclusion checks and counts stale exclusions as covered when the aggregate exports the symbol."
  "2026-07-26T20:53:22.869Z","harness:codex","Final local verification: repo-wide coverage passed 375 test files and 6,428 tests at exact 100% statements (44,307/44,307), branches (31,445/31,445), functions (9,061/9,061), and lines (43,046/43,046). Full lint passed ESLint, zero jscpd clones, static quality, 100% docstrings, package boundary, token budgets, SDK surface, import-cost, and transport-floor gates. Security scan and pnpm audit reported no secrets or vulnerabilities; packed npx acceptance passed all 15 bundled packages."
